ZGeo change log
===============

Version 1.26.0 — 2026-11-12
Previous GitHub release: v1.25.0 (2026-11-12)

Overview
--------
ZGeo 1.26.0 removes the redundant format-specific size checks and extends
Excel export with per-check error worksheets and a summary worksheet.

Changes in 1.26.0
-----------------
- Removed the "Refine SHP size" and "Refine MIF/MID size" checks. Both
  are subsets of "Refine size", which already covers all formats,
  including SHP and MIF/MID.
- The checks window now contains 7 checks instead of 9.
- Excel export now adds a worksheet for every executed problem check that
  found issues. Each worksheet contains the columns:
  - "Full path";
  - "File";
  - "Feature ID";
  - "Where";
  - "Error description".
- Geometry and coordinate rows include the feature ID and the vertex or
  geometry location. Field-name rows include the layer and field name.
- A final "Check statistics" worksheet lists each executed check with the
  number of files that have issues and the number of error rows.
- The per-check worksheets respect the active file filter, like the main
  file list worksheet.
- README, metadata, translations and tests were updated.

Available checks in 1.26.0
--------------------------
Refinement:
- Refine size (all formats, including SHP and MIF/MID)
- Refine CRS and check it
- Refine feature count and check empty layers

Validation:
- Check JSON for GeoJSON format
- Field name check
- Dataset integrity check
- Geometry and coordinate check

Excel export sheets
-------------------
- "Files" — the filtered file list;
- "Statistics" — statistics by format;
- one sheet per problem check with issues;
- "Check statistics" — totals by check.

Compatibility
-------------
- QGIS 3.16 and newer, including QGIS 4 / Qt 6.
- Python 3.9+.
- Windows is the primary target; the plugin uses QGIS and PyQt APIs.

Installation
------------
1. Download `zgeo-1.26.0.zip`.
2. In QGIS open Plugins → Manage and Install Plugins → Install from ZIP.
3. Select the downloaded archive and restart QGIS if it was running.

